description: Cake& design system — how to build UI in this prototype
alwaysApply: true
---

Read [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) before writing any UI.

Props and tokens come from `node_modules/@cake-admin/cakeand/` — `types/` for the
API, `cakeand.css` for the token names. Before using a component, also read
`knowledge/components/<name>.cake.json` at the repo root for what it gets wrong.

Never hardcode a color, spacing, radius, or type size — token names are exact and
an invented one resolves to an empty string with no error. Never add a second UI
library. Prototype: ce-contacts.
